        "Kerosene 1913 (quantity 3,239,827 and value 511,348) and 1923 value (1,134,139) are single figures printed against braces covering American, Borneo and Sumatra; written in the middle (Borneo) row, the other two rows left empty. 1923 and 1924 quantities and 1924 values are given per row (with braces '{' printed beside the quantities).",
