        "'(1)' = footnote 1, Not available. Dotted rules written '...'.",
        "Chinese goods Flour 1924 quantity printed 446,909, the same figure as Beans 1924; kept as printed.",
        "A stray mark is printed before Lead, in pigs 1913 quantity '661'.",
        "Unit printed after the leader dots in the Commodities column; given its own column here. Figures printed with thin spaces after the commas; written without the spaces."
